  "version": "enrolled",
  "operative_text": "all sections: text not read\nSec. 3: K.S.A. 21-6302(a)(4) -- criminal carrying of a concealed firearm now limited to under-21: (4) any pistol, revolver or other firearm concealed on one's person if such person is under 21 years of age, except when on the such person's land or in the such person's abode or fixed place of business; or\nSec. 2: 21-6301 criminal use of weapons: Sec. 2. K.S.A. 2014 Supp. 21-6301 is hereby amended to read as follows: 21-6301. (a) Criminal use of weapons is knowingly:\nSec. 1: 21-5914 traffic in contraband in a correctional institution: Sec. 1. K.S.A. 2014 Supp. 21-5914 is hereby amended to read as follows: 21-5914.(a) Traffic in contraband in a correctional institution or care and treatment facility is\nSecs. 4-5, 6 (21-6308, 21-6309, 32-1002) and secs. 7-14 (75-7c01 to 75-7c21, personal and family protection act licence provisions): Sec. 16. This act shall take effect and be in force from and after its publication in the statute book.",
